#. Description of the plugin
#: wp2shell-scanner.php
msgid "Checks whether your site is exposed to — or was broken into through — PHP2Shell (CVE-2026-109618 / CVE-2026-109619, critical bugs in PHP itself) and wp2shell (CVE-2026-63030 / CVE-2026-60137, a WordPress core bug). Looks at your PHP and WordPress versions, webshells, rogue admins, changed files and server logs. Read-only — it never changes or deletes anything."
msgstr ""

